            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, there is, albeit not very convenient one. It requires making a custom mapping which emulates pressing \"mark\" + \"go down\" keys (thus should be mapped to some other key and not override default 'mark' keys, `<C-x>`). See [this comment](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/513#issuecomment-1764784504).",
